  "label": "Stealing Tambourines",
  "description": "Tambourines are musical instruments. 'Stealing tambourines' is a nonsensical, absurd concept that implies a person (or thing) is capable of theft, specifically targeting a musical instrument. This phrase is used in the meme to contrast with the washing machine's 'great' skill, creating a humorous juxtaposition. The act of stealing is a real-world criminal behavior, but the specific targeting of tambourines is arbitrary and comedic.",
